# Form QA contract

Full checklist: `docs/qa/CHECKLIST.md`. Findings: `docs/qa/FINDINGS.md`.

When adding or changing a form:

- Required fields need a marker, real validation, and in-cell errors (no grid shift).
- Email: empty and invalid both show a message; invalid copy includes the typed value.
- Address picker: search, current location, and pin fill derived fields; filling clears errors; clearing search clears city/state/country/postal/coords; lock derived fields while coords exist; do not prefer Plus Codes.
- Back / remount must not wipe or shift values (`getValues()` draft, distinct `autoComplete`).
- Reject disallowed file types in JS, not only `accept=`.
- `Other` needs required free text.

If the form exists in another client (web / ops-mobile / customer), apply the same contract there.

Website-only: public Back, industry `?product=` pricing. Do not copy those to mobile. Header Help/Integrations stay footer-only until a compact treatment.
